<template>
  <div class="s-page"><div class="s-page-heading"><div><p class="s-eyebrow">02 / GENERATE</p><h1>创造你需要，尚未拥有的数据。</h1><p>基于已发现的结构构建候选样本，让数据扩充成为可验证的实验。</p></div><span class="s-engine-label"><span class="s-dot"></span>鼠先知引擎</span></div>
    <div v-if="!ready" class="s-panel s-empty"><el-icon><MagicStick /></el-icon><h3>先理解数据，再创造数据</h3><p>完成一份数据的结构发现后，即可选择模式并生成候选窗口。</p><RouterLink to="/discover" class="s-button primary">前往结构发现 →</RouterLink></div>
    <template v-else><div class="s-generation-layout"><form class="s-panel s-generation-form" @submit.prevent="run"><span class="s-eyebrow">GENERATION RECIPE</span><h2>定义你的数据实验</h2><label class="s-field">源结构实验<select :value="studio.discovery.id" @change="studio.discoveryId = $event.target.value"><option v-for="j in studio.discoveries.filter(j => j.status === 'completed')" :key="j.id" :value="j.id">{{ studio.selected?.name }} · {{ j.id.slice(0, 8) }}</option></select></label><label class="s-field">目标覆盖<select v-model="target"><option value="all">整体分布</option><option v-for="cluster in studio.discovery.result.clusters" :key="cluster.id" :value="String(cluster.id)">{{ cluster.name }} · 当前 {{ percent(cluster.share) }}</option></select></label><p class="s-field-help">整体分布用于总体扩充；选择具体模式可探索低覆盖区域。</p><div class="s-two-col"><label class="s-field">生成窗口数<input v-model.number="count" type="number" min="8" max="512" required /></label><label class="s-field">随机种子<input v-model.number="seed" type="number" min="0" max="2147483647" required /></label></div><label class="s-field">变化幅度 <span>{{ strength.toFixed(2) }}</span><input v-model.number="strength" type="range" min="0.01" max="0.3" step="0.01" /></label><div class="s-range-labels"><span>靠近原始模式</span><span>探索更多变化</span></div><div class="s-recipe-summary"><span>窗口长度 <b>{{ studio.discovery.config.window }}</b></span><span>数值变量 <b>{{ studio.discovery.config.columns.length }}</b></span><span>预计数据点 <b>{{ number(count * studio.discovery.config.window) }}</b></span></div><button class="s-button primary full" :disabled="busy || running" type="submit"><el-icon><MagicStick /></el-icon>{{ running ? '鼠先知引擎正在生成…' : '生成并验证数据' }}</button></form>
    <div class="s-generation-explainer"><section class="s-panel s-generate-story"><span class="s-eyebrow">STRUCTURE-AWARE AUGMENTATION</span><h2>补足覆盖，<br />不止于增加数量。</h2><p>每次生成都是一条完整的实验链：明确来源，构建候选，验证结构，评估用途。</p><ol class="s-vertical-steps"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>定义需要的数据</strong><p>从模式覆盖与下游任务出发。</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>生成并筛选候选窗口</strong><p>围绕源数据的结构探索新样本。</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>回到独立数据上验证</strong><p>分布、时序、效用与复制风险共同评估。</p></div></li></ol></section><div class="s-info-note"><el-icon><InfoFilled /></el-icon><p>合成窗口相互独立，不应拼接成连续时间轴。数据扩充是否有价值，需要结合真实留出数据与具体任务判断。</p></div></div></div>
    <JobStatus :job="studio.generation" />
    <section v-if="result" class="s-panel"><div class="s-section-heading"><div><span class="s-eyebrow">GENERATION COMPLETE</span><h2>{{ studio.generation.config.count }} 个新窗口，等待你的检验。</h2></div><RouterLink to="/evaluate" class="s-button primary">查看质量报告 →</RouterLink></div><p class="s-muted">实验 {{ studio.generation.id.slice(0, 8) }} · {{ result.sampling.candidates }} 个候选 · {{ percent(result.sampling.acceptance_rate) }} 接受率</p><label class="s-inline-field">查看变量<select v-model.number="channel"><option v-for="(name, i) in result.columns" :key="name" :value="i">{{ name }}</option></select></label><StudioChart :option="preview" /><p class="s-chart-note">展示独立窗口示例，仅用于直观比较；质量结论请查看评估报告。</p></section></template>
  </div>
</template>
<script setup>
import { computed, ref, watch } from 'vue'
import { useRoute } from 'vue-router'
import { MagicStick, InfoFilled } from '@element-plus/icons-vue'
import { useStudioStore } from '../../stores/studio'
import StudioChart from '../../components/studio/StudioChart.vue'
import JobStatus from '../../components/studio/JobStatus.vue'
import { lines, number, percent } from '../../components/studio/chartOptions'
const studio = useStudioStore(), route = useRoute(), count = ref(96), seed = ref(42), strength = ref(0.08), target = ref('all'), busy = ref(false), channel = ref(0)
watch([() => route.query.target, () => studio.discovery?.id], () => { const value = Number(route.query.target); target.value = route.query.target !== undefined && studio.discovery?.result?.clusters.some(c => c.id === value) ? String(value) : 'all' }, { immediate: true })
watch(() => studio.generation?.id, () => { channel.value = 0 })
const ready = computed(() => studio.discovery?.status === 'completed')
const running = computed(() => ['queued', 'running'].includes(studio.generation?.status))
const result = computed(() => studio.generation?.status === 'completed' ? studio.generation.result : null)
const preview = computed(() => lines(result.value ? [{ name: '源数据留出窗口', data: result.value.preview.real[0].map(p => p[channel.value]), itemStyle: { color: '#a1ada4' } }, ...result.value.preview.synthetic.map((curve, i) => ({ name: `合成窗口 ${i + 1}`, data: curve.map(p => p[channel.value]), lineStyle: { width: 1.7, type: i ? 'dashed' : 'solid' } }))] : []))
async function run() { busy.value = true; try { await studio.submit('generate', { discovery_id: studio.discovery.id, count: count.value, seed: seed.value, target: target.value === 'all' ? null : Number(target.value), strength: strength.value }) } catch { /* banner */ } finally { busy.value = false } }
</script>
